the show starts on a secluded korean  island knock doo is a fisherman living  with his father and older brother he  learns martial arts from the village  drunkard master and is promised to marry  his daughter when he grows up one  afternoon knock dew and the girl are  fishing when a man informs him that his  family is in trouble he rushes back home  to see a group of soldiers surrounding  his father yoon and brother huang a  battle follows and nakdu manages to  defeat them all having learned martial  arts his entire life one of the soldiers  is a woman who knock dew refuses to kill  he hurts her leg and allows her to flee  when everything calms down nakdu's  father tells him they have to leave the  island now that they have been found  from a very young age he was overly  protective of his sons as if someone was  looking for them he claims that he did  something in the past which affected  many vengeful high profiles hence he  faked his death and was on the run for  decades but today's attack means that  someone has found their whereabouts the  drunkard master reveals that the  soldiers were trained assassins which  means they were sent by someone to kill  the family he wants nakdu to go to the  emperor's city and find out who is the  person behind the attack yoon doesn't  want his son to get into trouble but  nakdu has decided to get to the bottom  of the situation no matter what in the  next scene we are taken to the emperor's  city the king is making a round of the  city in a palanquin surrounded by his  guards a woman named dongju is dressed  up as a man and is looking to kill the  king to avenge something that happened  to her family she gets ready with her  bow and arrow but is interrupted by a  running knock do they bicker for a  minute which causes her to miss the  palanquin suddenly an old man throws a  stone at the king slandering him for  killing his son to expand his palace the  guards are instantly altered and asked  to check the entire area for the old  man's accomplice in the following brawl  both knock do and dongju are caught  right before he is taken away nakdu sees  the woman who he injured back on his  island he wants to use her to get to her  boss but the guards arrest him before he  can assuming that dongju is a man she is  kept with the male prisoners where she  meets knock do again they bicker and  blame each other for their situation the  following morning they wake up close to  each other and jolt up in embarrassment  the guards take them to the  investigation bureau and dongju is asked  to introduce herself she goes blank  knowing that any lie will get her in  trouble since she is disguised as a man  when the investigation officer gets mad  at her for not speaking nak do comes to  her aid and distracts everyone he claims  that the investigation is fruitless and  the king must instead go to the grave of  the old man's son to gain sympathy from  his people his suggestion is taken into  consideration and they are ultimately  let free after that noctu and dongju go  their separate ways nakdu ends up at a  local inn at night the kind in owner  offers him food free of charge out of  the goodness of her heart what noctu  doesn't know is that it has been  poisoned by the female assassin an hour  after eating the food he feels nauseous  and runs outside the inn owner runs to  call the assassin but by then nakdu has  already fled the woman assumes he is  dead and returns home to meet her boss  nakdu follows her having thrown the food  instead of eating it he sees her  entering a hidden village and goes in  after her however nakdu soon regrets the  decision because the village belongs to  widowed women and men are strictly  prohibited to enter the female guards  beat him up before throwing him out  later that day nakdu sees a woman being  chased by a group of men he helps her  escape and finds out she is being  pursued by her family for falling in  love with a man of a lower castle the  lovers want to escape but the men who  want her dead are still outside the  widow's village waiting for her to  arrive to help them nakdu dresses up as  a woman and tricks the men they  eventually assume that their daughter  has left and quit pursuing her noc do  acts so well as a woman that even the  couple is shocked they thank him greatly  before leaving for a safer village the  next morning nakdu goes to the widow's  village dressed as a woman they welcome  him after he makes up a story about his  husband's death there are two parts of  the village the common grounds and the  kasang house where unmarried women stay  since there are no rooms vacant in the  village nakhdu is asked to share a room  in the casang house the women there  survive by making alcohol and clothes  for the palace they promise to teach  nakhdu a skill and help him sustain a  good life as he is being shown around a  nobleman tries to kidnap a little girl  to make her his wife a woman stands  against him refusing to let the child be  exploited nakdu looks closer at the girl  and realizes it is dongju he sees that  she is a woman and figures out that she  was dressed as a man when they first met  to make the nobleman go away dongju cuts  her hair which is said to be a kasang's  sacred jewel when he still remains  adamant the king's nephew and dongju's  friend nyung yang comes to her rescue he  embarrasses the man and kicks him out of  the village as the crowd disperses nak  do meets the manager of the kasang house  mr lee he instantly falls for his beauty  nak do is sent to the room that he is  supposed to share with dongju he goes  through her belongings and makes sure  she is the person he met in the village  yesterday she finds him snooping through  her bag and pushes him away they get  into a fight again before dongju asks  him to stay away from her belongings and  kicks him out later the manager meets  knock do and takes him by surprise by  expressing his love noctu doesn't know  what to make of the unwanted attention  and resorts to staying away from the man  while looking for the assassin he  figures out that the village's brewery  is where most women aren't allowed to go  before he checks what's inside three  women forcefully make him come to the  river to bathe with them knock dude  doesn't want to seem suspicious nor does  he want to pass on this sweet  opportunity but if he takes off his  clothes his secret will be out he  refuses as much as he can before jumping  into the water with his clothes on  suddenly the women look at him in shock  and throw a stone in his direction nakdu  freezes in shock before realizing that  they are looking at a man behind him the  kasang manager is caught red-handed  spying on them they knock him out  deciding to never talk about this again  in the following scene we are introduced  to the king's most beloved friend and  subject hyo yoon long ago nokdu's father  used to be good friends with the king  and yoon but at the end of the war yoon  asked noctu's father to run away with  knock do so they wouldn't have to get  killed by his hands the reason he wanted  to kill them all is still a mystery but  it is clear that nokdu's father has been  running away from the king all this time  another flashback shows us that a few  months earlier noctia's father bumped  into a man who recognized him he managed  to escape then but the king was informed  and the soldiers were sent to look for  him around the islands back in the  present the king asks a commander if he  was able to find knock do but the man  lies and claims that they didn't find  anyone somewhere else eunice told about  nakdu coming to the city in search of  the woman who attacked him he tightens  the security around the widow village  hoping to catch nakdu before he is found  by the king meanwhile in the village  nakthu and dongju have a sleep together  in a room dongju doesn't mind it  assuming that nakdu is a woman but nak  do is nervous the entire time when  everyone is asleep at night he goes out  and finds a group of women dressed as  the assassins he fought on the island it  is revealed that their group kills  misogynists and predators who harm other  women however their leader is someone  only the older women recognize to get to  the leader noctu follows the said women  but he is caught after a fierce sword  fight he manages to run back to the  casang house and pretends to be taking a  stroll the following day nakdu goes into  the brewery to try to socialize but he  ends up getting into a fistfight with a  woman after unintentionally calling her  ugly amidst the fight noctu sits on a  hot pan and burns his back while dongju  burns her hand they help each other by  applying medicine before going to sleep  that night the king comes to meet yoon  and inquires if he saw nakdu and his  father dying with his own eyes uniforms  even though he knows that he let them  run away out of mercy the king has his  suspicions regarding the story but he  decides to let it go for the night after  he falls asleep yoon asks his best man  to continue looking for knock do the  next morning nakdu bumps into the  assassin who he fought on the island she  finds him familiar and follows him but  nakdu manages to fool her by pretending  to be the kasang manager's escort still  he has to be careful because the  assassin is keeping a close eye on him  for the rest of the day nakdu helps  dongju with different things because of  her injury they eventually become  friends and dongju even suggests that  she call him sister get wrecked nakdu on  the other hand refuses to be called that  and asks her to stick to calling each  other by their names when it turns dark  an eerie noise is heard prompting all  the women to run into their houses nakdu  is told that the elders are performing a  ritual for the dead widows and no one  should be out of their houses at this  time he sees through the ruse because  the women performing the ritual are the  elder assassins he follows them 