ng her newborn son who died at the  time of war today was the day he was  born hence the day brings back memories  for her moreover she is eating the same  candies as knock do in her son's memory  the noble man who couldn't have his way  with the little girl returns to the  widow's village this time his eyes are  on dongju according to the rule the  kasang will have to hand her over to the  man if he wishes to take her home but  even so when the head kissing is told  about his intentions she declines trying  to save dongju from a monster like him  the noble man makes a scene threatening  to sell the entire village as a result  dongju agrees to go with him in the  meantime nakdu is hiding inside a  cupboard to spy on the assassins who are  planning a way to kill their new target  a woman opens the cupboard  mid-conversation and catches nakdu  red-handed he quickly recovers by saying  that he came to steal a ring to make  more money the women get ready to kill  him but then he offers to join their  group they hear his case and decide to  give him a chance but only if he manages  to kill the man in the next two days in  the last scene dongju is being taken  away in a palanquin while knock doo is  on his way to kill the target to see  what happens next watch the second part  in series recap

